---
layout: base.njk
title: Guides
description: Practical, verified guides to bulk editing on Shopify — prices, sales that revert themselves, safe deletion, and the habits that keep catalogs intact.
permalink: /guides/
---
<main class="guide wrap">
  <header class="guide-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Guides</p>
    <h1>Bulk editing on Shopify, done carefully</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ description }}</p>
  </header>
  <ul class="guide-list">
    {%- for g in collections.guide %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ g.url }}"><h2>{{ g.data.title }}</h2></a>
      <p>{{ g.data.description }}</p>
      <p class="guide-meta">Updated {{ (g.data.updated or g.data.date) | humanDate }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</main>
